ing  his beloved hammer and it's clear there  are still feelings between the two  valkyrie picks up on this and questions  thor about what's going on between them  jane's mighty thor has also shown  summoning lightning in a mysterious dark  hall or cave surrounded by gold statues  some of which appear to represent  important characters from marvel comics  such as the living tribunal the watcher  infinity and death additionally the  trailer takes us to olympus where we see  russell crowe zeus for the first time  surrounded by women the god has thor  chained to the floor and strips off all  of his clothes causing an astounding  number of people around zeus to faint  there was also a look at jane competing  in some kind of battle on olympus  promising both comedy and action in this  particular hall of the gods  during the thor love and thunder panel  at san diego comic con in 2019 taika ytt  revealed that the new movie is inspired  by the mighty thor comic story line from  2015. written by jason aaron the story  follows jane foster as she becomes the  goddess of thunder after wielding  mjolnir tragically jane also has breast  cancer at this time and every time she  holds a hammer and transforms the  chemotherapy is eradicated from her body  however mjolnir will not eliminate the  cancer from her system meaning she  significantly risks death by continuing  to wield the hammer despite knowing that  her heroism could lead to her death jane  transforms into the goddess of thunder  one too many times and she ultimately  dies after defeating asgardian threat  mangog however after her death jane  refuses to go through the gates of  valhalla and is resurrected by odin she  returns to earth then her cancer  eventually goes into remission could  this mean a surprise appearance by  anthony hopkins odin might be gone in  the mcu but if he meets jane at the  gates of valhalla anything is possible  jane's cancer storyline may have been  confirmed for thor love and thunder  thanks to the description of a replica  thor helmet that's part of the official  merchandise for the film the direct  picked up on this subtle leak as the  helmet's description reads suffering  from cancer astrophysicist and thor's  ex-girlfriend jane foster visited new  asgard and her life was changed forever  the marvel cinematic universe timeline  it's a fickle little sucker that is more  confusing now than it's ever been but  whenever a new mcu project comes around  we have to figure out where we're  supposed to jam it in thanks to the time  jumping avengers end game the actual  earth that we live on doesn't quite  match up with the date in the mcu as we  resign in 2022 earth's mightiest heroes  are living somewhere in 2024 or 2025  however it might be easier to pin thor  love and thunder on the timeline based  on what we see in the trailer thanks to  the appearance of the guardians of the  galaxy we can assume thor love and  thunder takes place shortly after the  events of avengers end game when thor  left earth then the fledgling new asgard  to go on an adventure with the space  faring team a lot of phase 4 mcu films  happen simultaneously so thor love and  thunder could very well be occurring  during the same time as films like  chongqi and the legend of the ten rings  or eternals  being an mcu movie thor love and thunder  comes with dime a dozen fan theories and  rumors since a project was announced  there has been much speculation about  who might be popping up in the film  cameos in the mcu are extremely hard to  keep a secret these days so the powers  that be can pull off a shocking cameo or  hats are off to them perhaps the biggest  rumored cameo is out of ryan gosling who  some believe is joining the mcu based on  one lunch gosselin and taika white tt  were spotted having together before  filming began on thor love and thunder  gossip site just jared shared photos of  the duo together in august 2019 and fans  began speculating who he might play on  reddit beta ray bill's name seems to  keep popping up all via fan theory but  it's also possible gosling isn't in this  at all inverse reported on some rumors  which they admitted were sketchy that  suggest jeff goldblum will reprise his  role as the grandmaster and rachel house  will also be back as topaz also possibly  appearing is teeny tiny throgg aka thor  but a frog we got a glimpse of the  amphibian and loki episode 5 which was  actually a surprise chris hemsworth  cameo  speaking of loki what about tom  hiddleston we haven't heard anything  official even though he seems to be dead  in the timeline thor love and thunder  takes place and you can't count out the  god of mischief after all there are so  many of them  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one
 

